### LearnLink - Notification System Tests
### Usage: IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client  OR  VS Code REST Client extension
### Replace {{token}} with a real JWT from the /api/auth/login endpoint

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJyb2xlIjoiU1RVREVOVCIsInVzZXJJZCI6MTEsInN1YiI6Inpha2FyaWFAZ21haWwuY29tIiwiaWF0IjoxNzczNzQyMTUyLCJleHAiOjE3NzM4Mjg1NTJ9.Y7yBG0AnjWuj9I6yRcs0LhqXLG-n_p_RU6hu2IxWjLA

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
###  STEP 0 - Get a JWT Token (Login first)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "zakaria@email.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
###  STEP 1 - Trigger a notification manually
###  (via the test endpoint we'll add below)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### F-N-01: Get ALL notifications (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### F-N-01: Get UNREAD notifications only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/unread?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### F-N-02: Get unread BADGE COUNT
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### F-N-03: Mark ONE notification as read (replace 1 with real ID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### F-N-03: Mark MULTIPLE notifications as read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notificationIds": [1, 2, 3]
}

###

### F-N-04: Mark ALL notifications as read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### F-N-06: Get notification PREFERENCES
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### F-N-06: Update notification PREFERENCES
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inAppEnabled": true,
  "emailEnabled": true,
  "emailTasks": true,
  "emailConnections": true,
  "emailMessages": false,
  "emailCommunity": true,
  "emailGamification": true,
  "emailSystem": true,
  "pushEnabled": false,
  "emailDigestEnabled": false,
  "emailDigestFrequency": "DAILY"
}

###

### F-N-06: Disable ALL email notifications
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailEnabled": false
}

###

### F-N-07: Get VAPID public key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/push/vapid-key
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Delete a notification (replace 1 with real ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
